    "status": "closed",
    "summary": "Commerce stores isolated Regular and optional Sale Money on existing draft simple products. Money is { currency: USD, minor } with USD only. Missing Regular is not listable and is never $0. $0 Regular is a free listable product. Sale requires Regular and must be strictly lower; invalid or orphan Sale is refused. Clearing Sale keeps Regular. Clearing Regular while Sale exists is refused. No admin UI, checkout, Inventory, coupons, payments, sale schedule, Manage Stock toggle, or template-store catch-up. Verify with bin/verify-commerce full."
  },
